{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29233","headline":"晨自竹径至龙兴寺崇隐上人院 · 许浑","name":"晨自竹径至龙兴寺崇隐上人院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"佛寺通南径，僧堂倚北坡。\n藤阴迷晚竹，苔滑仰晴莎。\n病忆春前别，闲宜雨後过。\n石横闻水远，林缺见山多。\n欲结三天社，初降十地魔。\n毒龙来有窟，灵鹤去无窠。\n客路随萍梗，乡园失薜萝。\n禅心如可学，不藉鲁阳戈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29233.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29233","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}